Dialogue: 10,0:00:17.66,0:00:19.92,dialog,,0,0,0,,Rasanya seperti pernah lihat...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:20.51,0:00:25.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku percayakan harta karun\NNona Luminus padamu.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:25.50,0:00:27.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu senjata pemungkas ultima
Dialogue: 10,0:00:27.82,0:00:30.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,yang menyegel Veldora.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:30.84,0:00:33.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lelucon macam apa ini, ya?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:33.85,0:00:37.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ternyata Raja Iblis yang melindungimu.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:39.85,0:00:44.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenapa kamu bisa tertidur di Tabut Suci?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:22.83,0:02:25.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa alasannya mengadu dombaku dengan Leon?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:25.94,0:02:28.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa tujuan Granville sebenarnya?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:29.02,0:02:31.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dilihat dari motifnya, aku punya tebakan.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:32.21,0:02:34.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,Yuuki Kagurazaka.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:34.71,0:02:38.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sepertinya dia membuat perjanjian\Ndengan Gran.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:42.18,0:02:44.39,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kami memang pura-pura bertarung sungguhan,
Dialogue: 10,0:02:44.39,0:02:46.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,tapi dia benaran sadar akan rencanaku, kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:46.85,0:02:47.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jawab.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:47.74,0:02:49.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bukan masalah.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:49.30,0:02:52.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dengan Prediksi Serangan Masa Depan,\Nsituasi berjalan sesuai rencana.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:52.82,0:02:56.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau begitu, biar Auto-Battle Mode\Nyang urus pertarungannya,
Dialogue: 10,0:02:56.69,0:02:59.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,lalu ungkap tujuan Granville!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:07.73,0:03:09.17,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Tidak teridentifikasi?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:10.67,0:03:14.43,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa maksudnya ini?\NSejak tadi Perebut tidak mempan.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:14.43,0:03:17.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,Skill yang harusnya unggul mutlak,\Nkenapa bisa gagal...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:18.32,0:03:23.60,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Perebut hanya bisa merampas\NSkill atau Art lawan satu kali.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:23.60,0:03:27.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Makanya saat di Ruang Ujian dulu,\Naku sengaja hanya menyalinnya,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:27.65,0:03:30.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,bukan merampasnya penuh.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:31.70,0:03:34.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,Heran karena tidak merampas Art dariku?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:36.72,0:03:38.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenapa malah terkejut?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:38.50,0:03:42.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kamu pikir aku tidak menyadari rahasiamu?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:43.20,0:03:46.67,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kamu sudah pernah merampas teknik dariku.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:46.67,0:03:50.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Karena itu, tidak akan mempan\Nuntuk kedua kalinya.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:50.58,0:03:52.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu tidak mungkin...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:55.07,0:03:56.99,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sudah kuduga.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:56.99,0:04:00.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hinata, kamu ini perhitungan,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:00.02,0:04:04.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,dan paling berbakat di antara muridku.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:04.10,0:04:06.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bahkan di antara Holy Knight terdahulu,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:06.78,0:04:10.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,jarang ada yang mencapai levelmu.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:10.10,0:04:14.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi, kamu tidak terbiasa bertarung\Nmelawan yang setara!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:15.68,0:04:17.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,Berisik!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:17.11,0:04:20.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau begini,\Nakan kugunakan kartu andalanku!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:24.90,0:04:26.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dengan Perebut Paksa,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:26.47,0:04:30.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,teknik lawan bisa kurampas sepenuhnya\Ntanpa memedulikan levelnya.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:30.08,0:04:33.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Akan kuhabisi kartu andalan Granville,\Ndan tuntaskan semua sekaligus!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:36.84,0:04:38.19,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mustahil!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:38.19,0:04:41.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Seharusnya tekniknya sudah pasti kurampas...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:41.10,0:04:45.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan-jangan,\Ndia sudah mengantisipasi akan dirampas?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:45.14,0:04:47.31,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ada apa, Hinata?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:47.31,0:04:51.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Wajahmu seperti tidak paham\Napa yang kulakukan.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:51.85,0:04:56.44,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kamu kira aku tidak menyiapkan\Nrencana melawanmu?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:02.28,0:05:04.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa yang sedang terjadi?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:04.48,0:05:09.29,dialog,,0,0,0,,Selain itu, rasa lelah ini bukan sekadar\Nefek samping Perebut Paksa.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:09.29,0:05:11.44,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sepertinya kamu kebingungan.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:11.44,0:05:14.27,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sederhana saja,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:14.27,0:05:18.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,aku hanya sengaja membuatmu memaksakan diri.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:19.97,0:05:21.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dengar,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:21.36,0:05:27.07,dialog,,0,0,0,,saat menghadapi lawan setara,\Nyang lebih dulu lelah akan kalah.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:27.07,0:05:30.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Karena penilaiannya jadi tumpul,\Ndan celah pun makin lebar.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:31.25,0:05:35.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Seperti yang sedang kamu alami saat ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:35.73,0:05:38.44,dialog,,0,0,0,,Iya, benar juga.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:38.85,0:05:42.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ternyata pria ini lebih tangguh dariku.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:42.20,0:05:45.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,Meski Perebut milikku bisa\Nmerampas Skill atau Art,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:45.86,0:05:49.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,kemampuan yang dia bangun\Ntidak bisa kurebut.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:49.50,0:05:55.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi ini yang disebut perbedaan level\Nyang lahir dari pengalaman.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:55.86,0:05:57.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku paham sekarang.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:57.57,0:06:01.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku harus bertarung dengan serius\Nkalau ingin mengalahkanmu.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:14.65,0:06:17.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,Benar, bertarunglah dengan serius.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:17.54,0:06:22.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau tidak, kamu tidak akan pernah\Nbisa melampauiku.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:23.09,0:06:24.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku akan menyerang, Granville!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:24.78,0:06:28.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku terima seranganmu, Hinata!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:39.88,0:06:44.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sudahlah, kamu tidak akan\Nmenang dariku, Bang Roy.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:44.01,0:06:45.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Benar begitu?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:45.63,0:06:49.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Selain itu, namaku Louis.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:49.20,0:06:51.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Roy adalah semacam kembaranku.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:51.60,0:06:54.39,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi jangan perlakukan aku sebagai kakaknya.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:54.39,0:06:56.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sudah kubilang percuma.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:03.86,0:07:05.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kekuatan macam apa itu?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:05.57,0:07:08.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Akhirnya aku mulai terbiasa.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:08.40,0:07:11.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Barusan itu variasi dari Blood Ray.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:11.33,0:07:16.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,Yah, begitu sudah diperlihatkan sekali,\Ntidak akan mempan lagi nanti.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:16.08,0:07:20.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,Gawat, sebenarnya apa yang dia incar?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:20.59,0:07:24.84,dialog,,0,0,0,,Makanya, matilah di sini sekarang!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:28.77,0:07:30.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sayang sekali.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:31.22,0:07:34.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku dan Roy bukan kembar,\Ntapi aslinya satu orang.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:34.85,0:07:41.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,Benar, dengan kematian Roy,\Naku mendapatkan kembali kekuatan asliku.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:41.11,0:07:45.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dulu aku dijuluki Bloody Lord.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:45.81,0:07:49.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nona Luminus menaklukkanku\Ndan menjadikanku bawahannya,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:49.98,0:07:52.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,tapi karena aku terlalu ganas,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:52.50,0:07:56.51,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nona Luminus memisahkanku jadi dua.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:56.51,0:07:58.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lalu aku diangkat jadi Kaisar Suci,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:58.90,0:08:01.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,dan Roy menjadi Raja Iblis.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:02.75,0:08:06.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,Karena itulah, aku bisa mengalahkanmu...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:06.84,0:08:10.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,Barusan itu benar-benar berbahaya.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:10.11,0:08:11.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mustahil!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:11.09,0:08:12.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ayo kita kabur, Footman!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:13.28,0:08:16.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau terus begini, kamu bisa mati!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:17.70,0:08:21.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sangat disayangkan,\Ntapi kemungkinannya begitu.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:22.42,0:08:23.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak akan kubiarkan!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:23.48,0:08:26.19,dialog,,0,0,0,,Gunther, kamu susul Nona Luminus!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:26.19,0:08:29.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ternyata tujuan mereka hanya\Nmengalihkan perhatian kami.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:29.01,0:08:30.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu berarti...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:30.49,0:08:32.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Yang mereka incar...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:33.74,0:08:37.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tahu dia bukan Maria.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:40.37,0:08:43.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Meski begitu, aku masih bisa merasakannya.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:43.98,0:08:45.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dasar Gran...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:45.69,0:08:49.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sampai menjadikan Maria yang begitu\Ndicintainya sebagai Servant.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:50.38,0:08:54.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku paham tekad Gran\Nyang dipertaruhkan dalam pertarungan ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:55.14,0:08:57.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi, lemah!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:07.63,0:09:12.43,dialog,,0,0,0,,Gran juga pasti tidak mengira\NMaria bisa mengalahkanku.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:12.94,0:09:15.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau begitu, incarannya adalah...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:21.18,0:09:22.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nona Luminus!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:22.58,0:09:25.19,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maaf telah membiarkan bandit itu lolos.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:25.19,0:09:29.23,dialog,,0,0,0,,Saat ini, Louis sedang mengejarnya,\Nsaya juga akan segera menyusul...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:40.69,0:09:42.99,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu tidak boleh...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:42.99,0:09:44.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:46.02,0:09:47.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nona Luminus!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:47.77,0:09:50.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,Berengsek kamu, Granville!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:01.18,0:10:04.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kamu berani sampai sejauh ini, Gran!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:06.80,0:10:08.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,Gunther!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:08.67,0:10:12.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Temukan para penyusup itu!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:12.59,0:10:14.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dimengerti!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:15.14,0:10:17.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sebenarnya ulah siapa ini?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:18.11,0:10:22.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hanya seseorang yang setara denganku\Nyang bisa merebutnya dariku.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:23.12,0:10:25.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bahkan Granville sampai\Nmemercayakan harapannya padanya.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:27.90,0:10:30.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu harus dijaga sampai waktunya tiba,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:30.59,0:10:33.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,kalau tidak, dunia bisa hancur.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:34.57,0:10:37.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu tidak akan kubiarkan terjadi!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:46.33,0:10:47.68,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:51.03,0:10:52.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Cahaya ini...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:03.89,0:11:06.19,dialog,,0,0,0,,A-Apa ini baik-baik saja?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:06.19,0:11:09.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pak Rimuru... Kak Hinata...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:09.76,0:11:11.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,Chloe!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:11.11,0:11:13.07,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hei, tunggu!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:16.74,0:11:18.99,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ah, sial!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:22.58,0:11:25.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan ke mana-mana!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:30.09,0:11:32.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pak Rimuru...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:35.20,0:11:37.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kak Leon?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:44.58,0:11:45.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Luminus.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:46.38,0:11:47.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nona Luminus...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:50.37,0:11:51.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Granville...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:52.51,0:11:57.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Rupanya kamu sungguh-sungguh\Nmemilih menjadi musuhku.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:00.03,0:12:02.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sungguh luar biasa, Nona Luminus.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:03.60,0:12:08.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bahkan Servant-ku\Ntidak bisa menahanmu sedikit pun.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:08.50,0:12:10.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dasar bodoh!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:10.46,0:12:13.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sebanyak apa pun kekuatan palsu\Nyang kamu tuangkan,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:13.30,0:12:16.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,boneka tanpa kehendak\Ntidak akan menandingi yang asli.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:16.26,0:12:19.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kamu pasti sudah tahu itu!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:19.90,0:12:23.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tentu saja, aku sangat tahu.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:23.12,0:12:24.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau begitu, kenapa...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:26.43,0:12:29.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Karena itu diperlukan.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:29.04,0:12:30.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Semuanya
Dialogue: 10,0:12:31.33,0:12:33.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,demi saat ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:35.03,0:12:36.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa maksudmu...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:58.13,0:12:59.51,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mustahil.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:00.54,0:13:03.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,Begitu rupanya, kamu...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:03.42,0:13:08.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kamu menuangkan semua Love Energy\Nyang kuberikan, ke dalam Maria!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:13.33,0:13:19.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,Setelah kematian harapan umat manusia,\NMaribel, harapanku pun sirna.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:20.99,0:13:24.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi, aku tetap tidak bisa\Nberhenti berharap!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:24.87,0:13:26.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kamu!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:26.12,0:13:26.91,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan remehkan aku!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:26.91,0:13:29.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Benar juga, Hinata.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:29.35,0:13:32.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku belum selesai membimbingmu.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:35.34,0:13:36.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hinata!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:38.88,0:13:40.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Melt Slash?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:40.94,0:13:45.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia bisa memanipulasi partikel roh\Ntanpa mantra?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:45.76,0:13:46.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:46.76,0:13:50.27,dialog,,0,0,0,,Benar, lebih kuat dari yang kita duga.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:50.27,0:13:54.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hinata, aku selalu bertanya-tanya
Dialogue: 10,0:13:54.77,0:13:57.31,dialog,,0,0,0,,kenapa kamu tidak bisa menjadi Pahlawan.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:57.76,0:14:01.31,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bakat dan usaha saja tidak cukup\Nuntuk mencapai Pahlawan.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:01.31,0:14:06.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau tidak dicintai roh, kamu tidak akan\Nmemenuhi syarat sebagai Pahlawan.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:06.32,0:14:10.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi, kamu dicintai roh.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:10.90,0:14:15.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sayang sekali.\NYang tidak bisa, memang tidak bisa.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:16.48,0:14:20.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hinata, kamu menyimpan\Nkegelapan di hatimu, kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:21.26,0:14:24.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kamu pernah membunuh orang terdekatmu?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:24.46,0:14:26.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sahabat? Saudara?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:26.76,0:14:27.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Atau orang tua?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:27.89,0:14:28.64,dialog,,0,0,0,,Diam!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:37.48,0:14:40.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Perbedaan kekuatannya terlalu jauh!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:41.02,0:14:44.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kamu belum menerima roh cahaya.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:44.46,0:14:46.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Atasi itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:46.35,0:14:51.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kegelapan hanyalah bayangan\Nyang diciptakan hatimu sendiri.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:51.49,0:14:52.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Diam...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:52.95,0:14:57.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terimalah dirimu di masa lalu,\Ndan banggalah dengan caramu hidup sekarang.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:57.89,0:14:59.92,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kelak kamu akan meraih cahaya...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:59.92,0:15:01.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kubilang diam!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:02.70,0:15:05.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sayang sekali, Hinata.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:05.32,0:15:09.66,dialog,,0,0,0,,Andai ada lebih banyak waktu,\Naku bisa membimbingmu.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:10.18,0:15:13.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau tidak paham lewat penjelasan,\Nalami sendiri saja.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:13.06,0:15:16.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau tidak bisa melindungi\Napa yang ingin dilindungi,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:16.02,0:15:20.27,dialog,,0,0,0,,tidak pantas bicara soal menyelamatkan dunia.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:21.19,0:15:25.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lapor. Menurut Prediksi Serangan\NMasa Depan, targetnya...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:25.57,0:15:28.07,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Individu Chloe Aubert.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:29.91,0:15:31.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,Chloe!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:31.16,0:15:31.99,dialog,,0,0,0,,Chloe katamu?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:52.64,0:15:54.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aduh...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:58.65,0:16:00.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hinata...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:02.66,0:16:04.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kak Hinata...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:06.69,0:16:07.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,Venom!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:07.57,0:16:09.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,Siap!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:10.62,0:16:12.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aduh, duh...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:12.16,0:16:13.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Chloe, kamu baik-baik saja?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:14.53,0:16:16.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bagaimana dengan Kak Hinata?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:16.12,0:16:18.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hinata, bertahanlah!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:19.46,0:16:21.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Gawat, dia bisa mati...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:21.87,0:16:24.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kak Hinata, jangan mati!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:24.82,0:16:27.44,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini obat penyembuh!\NTolong jaga anak-anak yang lain!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:27.44,0:16:28.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Siap!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:30.30,0:16:31.44,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hei, Luminus...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:31.44,0:16:35.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Diam dulu!\NErosi partikel roh ini terlalu cepat!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:35.06,0:16:40.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lapor. Partikel roh merusak tubuh spiritual\Nindividu Hinata Sakaguchi.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:40.38,0:16:43.52,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau dibiarkan, erosi akan merambat\Nsampai ke tubuh jiwa.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:43.52,0:16:46.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Berarti, Hinata sekalipun...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:53.70,0:16:54.67,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hinata!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:54.67,0:16:56.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kak Hinata!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:56.10,0:17:00.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bagus!\NPertahankan kesadaranmu, Hinata!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:01.15,0:17:04.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nona Luminus, aku...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:05.05,0:17:07.17,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan bicara dulu!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:10.95,0:17:12.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Chloe...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:12.91,0:17:15.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Syukurlah kamu selamat.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:17.72,0:17:22.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Chloe, aku percayakan ini padamu...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:24.11,0:17:26.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Meski sebagai gurumu...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:27.23,0:17:30.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tidak bisa berbuat apa-apa...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:31.63,0:17:34.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kamu pasti bisa
Dialogue: 10,0:17:35.47,0:17:37.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,melampauiku.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:37.82,0:17:40.64,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kak Hinata...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:52.88,0:17:54.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa ini?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:56.49,0:17:57.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:58.53,0:17:59.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenapa...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:01.89,0:18:05.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tidak tahu soal ini...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:06.90,0:18:09.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hei, Chloe?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:09.15,0:18:11.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenapa begini?\NMasih terlalu awal!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:21.37,0:18:22.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Barusan itu apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:22.93,0:18:24.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hei!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:24.50,0:18:27.79,dialog,,0,0,0,,Di mana Chloe?\NApa yang kamu lakukan padanya?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:27.79,0:18:29.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku juga tidak tahu...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:29.78,0:18:32.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak diketahui.\NIni situasi tidak wajar.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:32.11,0:18:36.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Belum bisa dipastikan apa yang terjadi pada\Nindividu Chloe Aubert secara utuh.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:36.85,0:18:37.44,dialog,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:37.44,0:18:39.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Resurrection!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:44.35,0:18:46.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenapa?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:46.01,0:18:50.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,Padahal belum lama sejak dia mati,\Nkenapa Resurrection tidak mempan?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:50.86,0:18:52.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bohong...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:52.35,0:18:53.41,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jawab.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:53.41,0:18:56.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jiwa individu Hinata Sakaguchi\Ntampaknya telah lenyap.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:56.95,0:19:02.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dengan cara apa pun, partikel data\Nyang hilang mustahil dipulihkan.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:03.23,0:19:06.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hinata, maafkan aku.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:06.06,0:19:09.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kamu sampai bernasib begini\Npadahal ada aku di sini...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:09.71,0:19:11.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan meratap begitu.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:11.71,0:19:14.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Semua ini sesuai rencanaku.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:14.99,0:19:19.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Rencana terakhir\Nberjalan sangat lancar, Luminus.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:19.73,0:19:21.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak akan kumaafkan.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:22.10,0:19:24.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak akan pernah kumaafkan!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:24.64,0:19:27.29,dialog,,0,0,0,,Akan kucabik-cabik kamu!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:27.77,0:19:31.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terkonfirmasi.\NSyarat telah terpenuhi.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:31.36,0:19:33.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Skill Unik, Lust,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:33.74,0:19:37.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,berevolusi menjadi Skill Ultima, Asmodeus.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:37.28,0:19:39.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Semua sudah tidak penting lagi!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:39.60,0:19:45.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kekuatan yang tidak berguna di saat genting,\Nbagiku itu tidak ada artinya!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:45.04,0:19:48.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kamu ingin penyelesaian, kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:48.04,0:19:51.17,dialog,,0,0,0,,Akan kukirim kamu ke alam baka, Granville!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:03.92,0:20:05.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Energi macam apa ini?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:06.54,0:20:07.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalian baik-baik saja?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:09.27,0:20:11.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aman terkendali!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:11.02,0:20:12.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kami juga baik-baik saja.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:14.57,0:20:16.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maaf terlambat melapor, Tuan Rimuru.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:16.78,0:20:19.66,dialog,,0,0,0,,Diablo, ya?\NSyukurlah masih sempat.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:19.66,0:20:21.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tolong jaga rekan-rekan kita!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:21.46,0:20:23.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dimengerti.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:25.56,0:20:26.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan-jangan...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:37.84,0:20:40.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aura macam apa ini?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:40.74,0:20:43.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lapor. Target adalah tubuh material.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:44.26,0:20:46.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terdeteksi energi di luar batas kewajaran.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:46.46,0:20:49.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Batas atasnya setara individu Veldora.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:49.65,0:20:50.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:50.35,0:20:52.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi kamu?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:52.11,0:20:55.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kamu yang menghancurkan Tabut Suciku?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:56.24,0:20:57.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Yuuki...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:57.36,0:21:01.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kamu yang namanya Luminus?\NAku Yuuki Kagurazaka.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:01.38,0:21:02.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Salam kenal.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:02.74,0:21:05.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Diam!\NSebenarnya apa yang kamu incar?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:05.98,0:21:09.66,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sampai melepas segel kekuatan roh\Ndan membangunkan Chronoa!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:09.66,0:21:11.67,dialog,,0,0,0,,Chronoa?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:11.67,0:21:14.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oh, jadi namanya Chronoa.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:14.70,0:21:18.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Yah, aku kaget waktu pertama kali dengar.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:18.05,0:21:22.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Siapa sangka harta karun yang terus\Ndisembunyikan Raja Iblis Luminus,
Dialogue: 10,0:21:22.00,0:21:25.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,adalah Pahlawan yang menyegel Naga Badai.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:25.93,0:21:27.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pahlawan?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:27.78,0:21:30.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Gadis itu seorang Pahlawan?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:30.18,0:21:33.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Memang Pahlawan, tapi bukan Pahlawan.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:33.47,0:21:38.44,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sekarang lebih seperti\Nwujud kehancuran bernama Chronoa.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:40.24,0:21:43.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kerja bagus, Yuuki.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:43.02,0:21:47.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bahkan aku pun tidak bisa membuka\Nsegel kekuatan roh pada tabut itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:47.71,0:21:51.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,Karena itu, aku memanfaatkanmu.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:51.08,0:21:54.66,dialog,,0,0,0,,Yah, aku kalah dalam saling tipu ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:54.66,0:21:56.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku benar-benar dikelabui.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:57.02,0:21:59.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Berarti, tujuan Granville adalah...
Dialogue: 10,0:22:00.72,0:22:06.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia yang sudah lepas dari segel\Ntidak akan kalah dari apa pun.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:06.10,0:22:09.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Para Raja Iblis, kalian makhluk jahat...
Dialogue: 10,0:22:09.98,0:22:11.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Matilah kalian semua
Dialogue: 10,0:22:11.73,0:22:13.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,di sini!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:53.58,0:23:56.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kamu kembali lagi, ya?
Dialogue: 10,0:23:57.26,0:23:59.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi, kali ini...
Dialogue: 10,0:24:05.97,0:24:10.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Selanjutnya, "Pahlawan Chronoa, Bagian Awal".
